# Mario & Luigi: Superstar Saga (USA, A88E), from power-on to walking about on the Koopa Cruiser (ML-2: Bros. Info).
# Title: START. The letter, the castle and Mario's yard: A mashed, until you control the Toad in the brothers' house.
wait 180
mash START 4 40
mash A 86 60
shot a-house
wait 60
# The Toad finds Mario in the bath: through the kitchen and the living room to the green-tiled bathroom
# at the house's left (the steam), whose door is at its bottom left corner, round the orange pillar.
hold LEFT 80
hold DOWN 80
hold DOWN+LEFT 60
hold UP+LEFT 60
hold LEFT 60
hold DOWN 60
hold LEFT 60
hold DOWN+LEFT 30
hold UP+LEFT 40
hold UP 60
shot b-bathroom
# The bath, the run to the castle, Bowser's tutorial battle (ML-1/ML-3: logo) and the throne room: A mashed,
# until Mario is in the castle town's plaza (room 0x112).
mash A 310 30
shot c-plaza
wait 60
# The plaza: up the ledges (A jumps) to the path north, right of Luigi (talking to him doesn't help).
hold RIGHT 40
hold UP 200
hold UP+A 10
hold UP 60
hold UP+A 10
hold UP 60
hold LEFT 36
hold UP 300
shot d-path
# North up the path (Toadsworth's suitcase, SELECT unlocked), Bowser and the Koopa Cruiser, Luigi dragged aboard.
hold UP 20
press A 2
wait 28
hold UP 20
press A 2
